-- RestaurantMom demo seed data. Fictional restaurants on purpose: the repo is public,
-- so no fake bad reviews of real places.
--
-- RESETS the demo data: truncates restaurants and dishes (and restarts their ids), then
-- reloads everything below. chat_state is left alone. Safe to run repeatedly.
-- Run with: npm run db:seed   (or paste into the Neon SQL editor)

TRUNCATE dishes, restaurants RESTART IDENTITY CASCADE;


